      "article_id": "a1_60d9a62928835bdc945f9e4a",
      "headline": "Mass funeral in Gaza for 112 Palestinians killed in 2023 Israeli strike",
      "confirmed_facts": [
        {
          "fact_id": "f1",
          "text": "Mass funeral in Gaza for 112 Palestinians killed in 2023 Israeli strike - Published Large crowds turned out in Gaza City for a mass funeral for 112 people, mostly women and children, who were killed in an Israeli strike on a residential block in late 2023, early in the Gaza war.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-05T08:03:36.522740+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "f94fddca313cc4b7c153711296abe20e83267f783bd91ac7ad385c5040e344c8",
          "excerpt": "Mass funeral in Gaza for 112 Palestinians killed in 2023 Israeli strike - Published Large crowds turned out in Gaza City for a mass funeral for 112 people, mostly women and children, who were killed in an Israeli strike on a residential block in late 2023, early in the Gaza war.",
          "sentence_hash": "4f357ae6049e54dd2b09c9258ea0a775e64ec1c1b9012c781fb003863ecabf8d",
          "anchors": [
            "un",
            "mass",
            "and",
            "112 people"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f2",
          "text": "The bodies - belonging to members of two extended families - have only recently been recovered from under the rubble in a two-week-long operation.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-05T08:03:36.522778+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "f94fddca313cc4b7c153711296abe20e83267f783bd91ac7ad385c5040e344c8",
          "excerpt": "The bodies - belonging to members of two extended families - have only recently been recovered from under the rubble in a two-week-long operation.",
          "sentence_hash": "ddacfc91be980e90c9903ba7eac32d7dbcda3199ea5fc5cd6cb33082d13b2b54",
          "anchors": [
            "un"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f3",
          "text": "Dramatic footage showed the remains lined up in rows, each victim covered with a Palestinian flag and some with a photo of the dead, before relatives carried them away.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-05T08:03:36.522813+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "f94fddca313cc4b7c153711296abe20e83267f783bd91ac7ad385c5040e344c8",
          "excerpt": "Dramatic footage showed the remains lined up in rows, each victim covered with a Palestinian flag and some with a photo of the dead, before relatives carried them away.",
          "sentence_hash": "a15c527aaf004f364932f19010ca7c12222a5c8b50726048d92bdf924ffaeda0",
          "anchors": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f4",
          "text": "The funeral is said to be the biggest of its kind to have taken place in Gaza.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-05T08:03:36.522835+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "f94fddca313cc4b7c153711296abe20e83267f783bd91ac7ad385c5040e344c8",
          "excerpt": "The funeral is said to be the biggest of its kind to have taken place in Gaza.",
          "sentence_hash": "5b3c658860f24e743cf24b87b006af3f20e4eb1daa66b52d475e5a5a657d6b7c",
          "anchors": [
            "un",
            "its"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f5",
          "text": "\"I think this is a feeling that was supposed [to be felt], a feeling of pain, grief and loss,\" said one mourner, Ali Abu Sharia.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-05T08:03:36.522862+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "f94fddca313cc4b7c153711296abe20e83267f783bd91ac7ad385c5040e344c8",
          "excerpt": "\"I think this is a feeling that was supposed [to be felt], a feeling of pain, grief and loss,\" said one mourner, Ali Abu Sharia.",
          "sentence_hash": "7a83fed91e0c1bf5b33051faa95cd8af45dbbae96212dea8d0726279ac99464a",
          "anchors": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f6",
          "text": "\"After we managed to retrieve them and bury them, perhaps we can be partially relieved despite the pain of loss and all we're still living through.\" Forty-four children, 38 women and seven people with disabilities were listed among the dead from the Abu Sharia and Hassayna famili",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-05T08:03:36.522905+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "f94fddca313cc4b7c153711296abe20e83267f783bd91ac7ad385c5040e344c8",
          "excerpt": "\"After we managed to retrieve them and bury them, perhaps we can be partially relieved despite the pain of loss and all we're still living through.\" Forty-four children, 38 women and seven people with disabilities were listed among the dead from the Abu Sharia and Hassayna famili",
          "sentence_hash": "ae1bbf3ae2bab08d13f500497a838266c2939a30288e6c63bd5a48b20b95cc14",
          "anchors": [
            "and"
          ]
        }
